{"id": "De5tiv2RmLI", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Hanuman flew INTO a monster's mouth… on purpose! 🐒🐍 How did he cross the ocean to Lanka? | Ramayan Part 9 of 12\n\n⛰️ To find Sita, Hanuman grew huge and pushed off Mount Mahendra. The whole mountain shook! (Valmiki Ramayana, Sundara Kanda 1)\n🌊 100 yojanas of ocean to Lanka! The sea raised a golden mountain, Mainaka, for him to rest on. Hanuman just touched it, said thanks, and flew on. (Sundara 1)\n🐍 The gods sent Surasa, mother of snakes, to test him: \"Into my mouth!\" He grew bigger, she opened wider… so he shrank, tiny as a thumb, zipped in and out, and she blessed him! (Sundara 1)\n🌑 Then the sea demon Simhika grabbed his SHADOW. He shot into her mouth and out, and she sank. (Sundara 1)\n🐈 At night, he shrank to the size of a cat and crept into Lanka, the city of gold. (Sundara 2)\n💤 In Ravana's palace he saw a queen asleep and thought she was Sita! He kissed his tail and danced… then stopped: Sita would never sleep happily there. (Sundara 10–11)\n💍 At last, in the Ashoka grove, he found Sita under a tree, softly told her Ram's story, and gave her Ram's ring. (Sundara 15, 31, 36)\n\n➡️ Part 10: Hanuman sets Lanka on fire! Follow @therishikatha so you don't miss it!\n\n📚 Rishi Katha picture books tell our gods' stories for kids, in simple words and bright pictures → rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n💬 Comment JAI HANUMAN 🙏 if he's your favourite!\n🔖 Save this, and share it with a kid who loves Bajrangbali 🧡\n\n#ramayan #ramayana #hanuman #bajrangbali #jaihanuman #sundarakand #valmikiramayana #jaishriram #sita #lanka #sanatandharma #hindumythology #ramayanseries #rishikatha #mythologyforkids", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792897976, "like_count": 1791, "comment_count": 27, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1481107907207804a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 51.184, "asr": 48000